G241  WHICH EFE IS THE FRAMEWORK'S?  modified inertia derived, QUMOND vs AQUAL
      MI: mu(|a|/a0) a = g_N,total  ->  a = nu(|g_b+g_ext|/a0)(g_b+g_ext)  == QUMOND's prescription
